{"3626540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cinderline", "steam_appid": 3626540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4832670], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626540/extras/049afa39659d0942e4fde23e7f0b93ca.poster.avif?t=1788016158\" width=1170 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626540/extras/049afa39659d0942e4fde23e7f0b93ca.webm?t=1788016158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626540/extras/049afa39659d0942e4fde23e7f0b93ca.mp4?t=1788016158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This system is getting old. Drive on the Cinderline as an anthropomorphic bird, exploring strange towns as you journey to create the last S'MORE and bring its youthful delight to the Heart of the aging system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the system ages the ash falls and thing are not quite as they used to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Gameplay</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626540/extras/2d92682691106951bd729786461d1fa8.poster.avif?t=1788016158\" width=1170 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626540/extras/2d92682691106951bd729786461d1fa8.webm?t=1788016158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626540/extras/2d92682691106951bd729786461d1fa8.mp4?t=1788016158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operate Your Train</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your train underground, arrive at each station made unique, and explore. The more you venture to the Heart the more surreal things become. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Strange Towns</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Visit strange places and meet weird people shaped by the system. Fulfill their little deeds and maybe they will help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to Residents</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with strange characters who might help you or sometimes mock you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last S'MORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the hidden ingredients in each town and reach the last station to feed it to the Heart to make them young again.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626540/extras/049afa39659d0942e4fde23e7f0b93ca.poster.avif?t=1788016158\" width=1170 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626540/extras/049afa39659d0942e4fde23e7f0b93ca.webm?t=1788016158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626540/extras/049afa39659d0942e4fde23e7f0b93ca.mp4?t=1788016158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This system is getting old. Drive on the Cinderline as an anthropomorphic bird, exploring strange towns as you journey to create the last S'MORE and bring its youthful delight to the Heart of the aging system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the system ages the ash falls and thing are not quite as they used to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Gameplay</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626540/extras/2d92682691106951bd729786461d1fa8.poster.avif?t=1788016158\" width=1170 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626540/extras/2d92682691106951bd729786461d1fa8.webm?t=1788016158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626540/extras/2d92682691106951bd729786461d1fa8.mp4?t=1788016158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operate Your Train</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your train underground, arrive at each station made unique, and explore. The more you venture to the Heart the more surreal things become. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Strange Towns</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Visit strange places and meet weird people shaped by the system. Fulfill their little deeds and maybe they will help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to Residents</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with strange characters who might help you or sometimes mock you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last S'MORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the hidden ingredients in each town and reach the last station to feed it to the Heart to make them young again.</p>", "short_description": "Drive the Cinderline as an anthropomorphic bird, exploring strange towns in an aging system. Gather ingredients to create the last S’MORE and deliver its delight to the Heart that keeps the system alive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https: